 "description": "Query any City of Toronto datastore resource (open.toronto.ca, CKAN) by its resource id (a UUID). Supports a free-text `q`, exact-match `filters` (field\u2192value), `sort` (\"field desc\"), limit and offset. Use toronto_datasets to find a resource id, or toronto_recent for the common ones.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "examples": [
